'''Moneko''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1, though in the [[The Battle Cats POP!|Nintendo 3DS version]], Moneko is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] and can be unlocked via the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] and is available in the pool starting in [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]] decreases recharge time, increases HP and [[Critical Hit|Critical]] chance, and gains the [[Mini-Wave]] ability.

